      "text": "Nice!\n\nNext step: using raw HTML/CSS/JavaScript\n\nEven as an enthusiastic maker of many #PowerShell web tools, I really wish more people understood that #HTML in PowerShell is as easy as:\n\n\"<h1>$variable</h1>\"\n\nIt's like if #PHP could talk to everything #DotNET and had an object pipeline."
